    [*] --> open : Pick Slider or open a post
    open --> settingUp
    settingUp --> addPhotos : Post found, empty
    settingUp --> editing : Post has slides
    settingUp --> noItem : No plan item id
    noItem --> [*] : Back to projects
    addPhotos --> preparingPhotos : Choose photos
    preparingPhotos --> editing : Photos ready
    editing --> askKria : Tap the AI button
    askKria --> editing : Kria edits or proposes
    editing --> saving : Tap Save
    saving --> editing : Saved
    editing --> photosDenied : Save to Photos, access denied
    photosDenied --> editing : Back to editing
    editing --> exporting : Export, iPhone can render it
    editing --> serverRender : Export, needs the server
    serverRender --> serverRender : Polling every 1.5s
    serverRender --> done : Render ready
    serverRender --> renderSlow : 200 polls, still rendering
    serverRender --> renderFailed : Server render failed
    renderSlow --> editing : Try again later
    renderFailed --> editing : Try again
    exporting --> done : File ready
    exporting --> renderFailed : A slide fails to render
    done --> [*]

